 begin="00:07.985" end="00:09.026">이승주</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.250" end="00:17.705"><span begin="00:15.250" end="00:15.602">나의 </span><span begin="00:15.602" end="00:15.964">두 </span><span begin="00:15.964" end="00:16.433">눈을 </span><span begin="00:16.433" end="00:17.705">감으면</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.131" end="00:21.689"><span begin="00:19.131" end="00:20.146">떠오르는 </span><span begin="00:20.146" end="00:20.777">그 </span><span begin="00:20.777" end="00:21.689">눈동자</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.017" end="00:25.569"><span begin="00:23.017" end="00:23.458">자꾸 </span><span begin="00:23.458" end="00:24.140">가슴이 </span><span begin="00:24.140" end="00:25.569">시려서</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.345" end="00:29.281"><span begin="00:26.345" end="00:27.858">잊혀지길 </span><span begin="00:27.858" end="00:29.281">바랬어</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.649" end="00:37.057"><span begin="00:30.649" end="00:32.073">꿈이라면 </span><span begin="00:32.506" end="00:33.124">이제 </span><span begin="00:33.124" end="00:35.057">깨어났으면 </span><span begin="00:36.310" end="00:37.057">제발</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.274" end="00:42.794"><span begin="00:38.274" end="00:39.050">정말 </span><span begin="00:39.050" end="00:39.633">네가 </span><span begin="00:40.217" end="00:40.747">나의 </span><span begin="00:40.747" end="00:42.001">운명인 </span><span begin="00:42.001" end="00:42.794">걸까</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.012" end="00:46.961"><span begin="00:44.012" end="00:45.009">넌 </span><span begin="00:45.494" end="00:46.202">falling </span><span begin="00:46.202" end="00:46.961">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.425" end="00:49.769"><span begin="00:48.425" end="00:48.873">운명처럼 </span><span begin="00:48.873" end="00:49.265">너를 </span><span begin="00:49.265" end="00:49.769">falling</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.105" end="00:51.666"><span begin="00:50.105" end="00:50.410">또 </span><span begin="00:50.410" end="00:50.745">나를 </span><span begin="00:50.745" end="00:51.185">부르네 </span><span begin="00:51.185" end="00:51.666">calling</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.306" end="00:55.170"><span begin="00:52.306" end="00:52.625">헤어 </span><span begin="00:52.625" end="00:52.865">나올 </span><span begin="00:52.865" end="00:53.209">수 </span><span begin="00:53.209" end="00:53.569">없어 </span><span begin="00:53.569" end="00:54.105">제발 </span><span begin="00:54.105" end="00:54.433">hold </span><span begin="00:54.883" end="00:55.170">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.826" end="00:57.409"><span begin="00:55.826" end="00:56.249">내 </span><span begin="00:56.249" end="00:56.537">인연의 </span><span begin="00:56.537" end="00:56.970">끈이 </span><span begin="00:56.970" end="00:57.409">넌지</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.809" end="00:59.297"><span begin="00:57.809" end="00:58.322">기다린 </span><span begin="00:58.322" end="00:58.745">네가 </span><span begin="00:58.745" end="00:59.297">맞는지</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.906" end="01:02.793"><span begin="00:59.906" end="01:00.346">가슴이 </span><span begin="01:00.346" end="01:00.754">먼저 </span><span begin="01:00.754" end="01:01.089">왜 </span><span begin="01:01.089" end="01:02.793">내려앉는지</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.794" end="01:06.321"><span begin="01:03.794" end="01:04.602">Stay </span><span begin="01:04.602" end="01:05.561">with </span><span begin="01:05.561" end="01:06.321">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.545" end="01:11.459"><span begin="01:06.545" end="01:06.801">내 </span><span begin="01:06.801" end="01:07.389">마음속 </span><span begin="01:07.389" end="01:08.227">깊은 </span><span begin="01:08.227" end="01:09.159">곳에 </span><span begin="01:09.159" end="01:10.065">네가 </span><span begin="01:10.065" end="01:11.459">사는지</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.657" end="01:13.974"><span begin="01:11.657" end="01:12.290">Stay </span><span begin="01:12.290" end="01:13.242">with </span><span begin="01:13.242" end="01:13.974">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.212" end="01:17.291"><span begin="01:14.212" end="01:14.459">내 </span><span begin="01:14.459" end="01:14.873">안에 </span><span begin="01:14.873" end="01:16.348">숨겨왔던 </span><span begin="01:16.348" end="01:17.291">진실</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.652" end="01:21.217"><span begin="01:18.652" end="01:19.049">나의 </span><span begin="01:19.049" end="01:19.362">두 </span><span begin="01:19.362" end="01:19.857">눈을 </span><span begin="01:19.857" end="01:21.217">감으면</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.481" end="01:25.057"><span begin="01:22.481" end="01:23.506">떠오르는 </span><span begin="01:23.506" end="01:24.146">그 </span><span begin="01:24.146" end="01:25.057">눈동자</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.377" end="01:28.836"><span begin="01:26.377" end="01:26.842">자꾸 </span><span begin="01:26.842" end="01:27.449">가슴이 </span><span begin="01:27.449" end="01:28.836">시려서</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.673" end="01:32.641"><span begin="01:29.673" end="01:31.217">잊혀지길 </span><span begin="01:31.217" end="01:32.641">바랬어</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.993" end="01:40.449"><span begin="01:33.993" end="01:35.401">꿈이라면 </span><span begin="01:35.963" end="01:36.449">이제 </span><span begin="01:36.449" end="01:38.433">깨어났으면 </span><span begin="01:39.651" end="01:40.449">제발</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.633" end="01:46.122"><span begin="01:41.633" end="01:42.407">정말 </span><span begin="01:42.407" end="01:43.017">네가 </span><span begin="01:43.593" end="01:44.085">나의 </span><span begin="01:44.085" end="01:45.405">운명인 </span><span begin="01:45.405" end="01:46.122">걸까</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.345" end="01:50.278"><span begin="01:47.345" end="01:48.345">넌 </span><span begin="01:48.870" end="01:49.554">falling </span><span begin="01:49.554" end="01:50.278">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.107" end="02:06.281"><span begin="02:05.107" end="02:05.529">가슴은 </span><span begin="02:05.529" end="02:05.949">뛰고 </span><span begin="02:05.949" end="02:06.281">있어</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.729" end="02:08.265"><span begin="02:06.729" end="02:07.154">여전히 </span><span begin="02:07.154" end="02:07.465">널 </span><span begin="02:07.465" end="02:07.899">보고 </span><span begin="02:07.899" end="02:08.265">있어</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.818" end="02:11.170"><span begin="02:08.818" end="02:09.377">자꾸만 </span><span begin="02:09.377" end="02:09.913">숨이 </span><span begin="02:09.913" end="02:11.170">막혀서</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.731" end="02:13.970"><span begin="02:12.731" end="02:13.233">아직은 </span><span begin="02:13.233" end="02:13.970">멀리에서</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.371" end="02:15.841"><span begin="02:14.371" end="02:14.809">너를 </span><span begin="02:14.809" end="02:15.353">지켜보고 </span><span begin="02:15.353" end="02:15.841">싶어</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.561" end="02:18.882"><span begin="02:16.561" end="02:16.930">내가 </span><span begin="02:16.930" end="02:17.211">또 </span><span begin="02:17.211" end="02:17.633">왜 </span><span begin="02:17.633" end="02:18.882">이러는지</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.385" end="02:21.946"><span begin="02:20.385" end="02:20.683">처음 </span><span begin="02:20.683" end="02:20.969">너를 </span><span begin="02:20.969" end="02:21.491">봤을때부터 </span><span begin="02:21.491" end="02:21.946">다르게</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.282" end="02:24.505"><span begin="02:22.282" end="02:22.674">운명의 </span><span begin="02:22.674" end="02:22.978">시간은 </span><span begin="02:22.978" end="02:23.377">또 </span><span begin="02:23.377" end="02:23.961">더디게 </span><span begin="02:23.961" end="02:24.505">갔지</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.505" end="02:25.945"><span begin="02:24.505" end="02:24.802">내 </span><span begin="02:24.802" end="02:25.129">가슴은 </span><span begin="02:25.129" end="02:25.457">널 </span><span begin="02:25.457" end="02:25.945">향했고</span></p><p ttm:a